      <title>LSMSA Honors Four at Retirement Reception</title>
                                                                        
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      <link>https://www.lsmsa.edu/page/news-detail?pk=1678673&amp;nc=20751&amp;fromId=249284</link>
                                                                        
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      <description>NATCHITOCHES, LA — The Louisiana School for Math, Science, and the Arts celebrated the careers of four educators and staff members Thursday, May 7, at a Retirement Reception recognizing decades of collective service to the school and its students.</description>
                                                                        
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
      
